From 0361fd6be7e8e693d4dc427cfe4992eb8413f16b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sukrit Jaidee <45908411+SukritJaAIproject@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:08:59 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 34/34] fix(desktop): PCAP analysis survives a progress read
 during its write

The analysis worker replaced progress.json with no retry. On Windows the
replace fails while the sidecar has the file open for a status poll, and
the whole job died with WinError 5 (it failed the 1.7.0 build smoke test).
Progress writes now retry and are best-effort; result and job-state writes
retry before failing. The training test no longer leaves __pycache__ in
desktop/training, which ships inside the installer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
